# Immich's media library — originals, thumbnails, transcodes, and its own
# DB dumps. Lives on slartibartfast, backed up to B2 via Kopia (see
# SETUP.md). Never committed.
data/
# Postgres datadir (VectorChord/pgvecto.rs). Note: this is deliberately NOT
# what gets backed up — Immich's built-in DB dump (written into
# data/backups/) is, because upstream warns a file-copy of a live Postgres
# datadir won't reliably restore.
pgdata/
